# Landing project rule

Before changing the public site, admin UI, copy, or metadata, read:

- `.cursor/skills/therapy-visual-design/SKILL.md`
- `.cursor/skills/therapy-seo/SKILL.md`
- `.cursor/skills/therapy-copy/SKILL.md`

